    <description>French-door refrigerator at typical US dimensions, 0.900 wide x 0.700 deep x 1.780 high: two upper doors with vertical stainless bar handles and a lower freezer drawer with a horizontal handle, brushed stainless finish on a recessed dark plinth. Replaces Fuel's Fridge, which is a 0.588 m single-door unit.</description>
